  first | exact @GlobalTheory.Hk3.HoweDuality.latIdx_le_of_ker | exact GlobalTheory.Hk3.HoweDuality.latIdx_le_of_ker | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.Hk3.HoweDuality.latIdx_le_of_ker <;> assumption)
